{
    "name": "E2E SiteMinder - Publishers, hotels, room types and rate plans",
    "description": "Reads the publishers and hotels of the connected SiteMinder Exchange application, then the room types and rate plans of the first hotel, and one of each by its code.",
    "notes": {
        "aa9cf33f-7e2e-4e49-aeea-288eb676119c": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 208,
            "width": 560,
            "height": 384,
            "content": "## Needs a SiteMinder Exchange test account\n\nThis flow was never run: SiteMinder issues API access only to partners with a signed agreement.\n\nIt takes the **first publisher** SiteMinder returns and the **first hotel** of that publisher. That hotel must be activated for the application of the connected account, and its publisher must provide availability and rates (ARI). **Little Hotelier** and **SiteMinder Channel Manager** hotels have reservations only: with one of them as the first publisher, the room type and rate plan steps answer HTTP 405 and the flow fails. The test hotel SiteMinder sets up for certification is a Little Hotelier account, so ask the Partner Integrations team for a hotel of a publisher with ARI."
        }
    },
